+// 0218: a DSpark draft block of the trained size runs its Markov chain over its first n_steps draft rows
+// only (the vLLM-XPU Inkling port drafts n of the block's rows: inkling_xpu/dspark.py, _block); the rows
+// past them keep the unbiased base logits and are not drafts. 0 (the default): every row of the block.
+// Another value is another graph (it is part of the reuse check).
+LLAMA_API void llama_set_dspark_chain(struct llama_context * ctx, uint32_t n_steps);
+
 // Select which appended NextN block the DECODER_MTP graph runs (offset past
 // the trunk: il = n_layer() + offset). Used by the speculative NextN driver to
 // chain multiple trained NextN heads. Default 0 (first head).
